# Response shape

Follow [`.agents/context/output.md`](../../.agents/context/output.md).

First 1–3 sentences: answer or what changed. Match length to the task. Put
plans and bulky output in files (`.cursor/plans/`, `.scratch/`), not a chat dump.
When subagents return, summarize — do not paste their full output.
